  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Employees may apply for leave multiple times during the year, subject to\navailability of balance.",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK India Policy - Leave Policy"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Leave may be applied for a minimum of half a day.There is limit on the\nmaximum number of days, subject to availability of balance.",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK India Policy - Leave Policy"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "The\nleave\nmay\nbe\nprefixed\nand/or\nsuffixed\nwith\nother\nleave\ntypes/weekends/statutory holidays.",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK India Policy - Leave Policy"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Employees serving Notice Period can avail Sick Leave if they have sufficient balance.",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK India Policy - Leave Policy"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "The Leave without pay should not exceed more than a week.If it exceeds proper\nexplanation and it should be approved by Supervisor.\nThe Leave without pay is applicable for one month only for Medical treatment.\nThe Medical certificate and medical documents should be submitted for approval\nfrom Supervisor and HR .\nIf the LOP exceeds more than one month, Employee name will be terminated\nfrom Tecsack organisation.",
    "page": 5,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK India Policy - Leave Policy"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
